OL,3,GNEWSAFamous Christmas garland          
OL,4,Acelebrates platinum year               
OL,6,FThe tradition of a Christmas garland   
OL,7,Fhung 60ft (18m) across the inside of a 
OL,8,FNational Trust property is having its  
OL,9,F70th anniversary marked.               
OL,11,FA trust garden team has focused on     
OL,12,Fcreating a platinum theme to mark the  
OL,13,Fplatinum anniversary in the Great Hall 
OL,14,Fof Cotehele House, Cornwall.           
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
