OL,3,GNEWSAFamous Christmas garland          
OL,4,Acelebrates platinum year               
OL,6,FAmong the 33,000 flowers that make up  
OL,7,Fthe garland are rusty reds and vibrant 
OL,8,Fyellows, all carefully placed into a   
OL,9,Fpittosporum (shrub) base layer, all    
OL,10,Fweighing in at 110kg (17 stone). The   
OL,11,Fteam has also been using paper-thin    
OL,12,Fhonesty and German statice flowers to  
OL,13,Ffinish it off.                         
OL,15,FThe garland will be on show from       
OL,16,FSaturday 21 November until Tuesday 5   
OL,17,FJanuary 2027, from 10.30 GMT until     
OL,18,F16:00.                                 
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2 
